      "physical_scale_intent": "Major player arrival vehicle: broad four-legged transport lander with human-sized entry hatch, matching a 48-56-pixel astronaut. Four-tile footprint is separate from tall canvas and overhang.",
      "review_status": "reviewed_asset_only_not_gameplay_integrated",
